---
description: Keep the board's existing single-key shortcuts until their off switch or remap ships
paths:
  - '**/*.tsx'
  - 'src/client/**/*.ts'
---

# Shortcut standards

## Single-key shortcuts

- Keep the board's single-key shortcuts `v`, `h`, `f`, `n`, and `]` when an edit reaches their bindings, since an off switch or remap for them is planned as its own change.
- Bind no new single printable-character shortcut, so the exception to the `canon:ui-craft` keyboard guidance stays at those five keys.
